## 14. Linked List vs Python List

| Operation             | Python List | Singly Linked List |
| --------------------- | ----------: | -----------------: |
| Access by index       |        O(1) |               O(N) |
| Search                |        O(N) |               O(N) |
| Insert at beginning   |        O(N) |               O(1) |
| Delete from beginning |        O(N) |               O(1) |
| Insert at known node  |       O(N)* |              O(1)* |
| Extra link storage    |          No |                Yes |

`*` assumes the relevant position/node is already known.

